      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of erosion is a heavy burden, and it's natural to fear the loss of who you are. If you feel like your self is slipping away, that sense of fading can be terrifying. Please know that there are professionals who specialize in helping people navigate these feelings of dissociation and mental decline. Reaching out to a therapist or doctor can give you tools to manage this erosion before it feels irreversible.",
      "source": "target",
